{"_note":"首屏三态的中间那一行:进页时若渲的是旧货(`_stale=1`),后台校新一次。挂 `root.events.onLoad` —— gate 全生命周期恰好一次,软重载不重置。⚠️ 绝不能改挂 onVisible(每次可见都触发 = 死循环)。","version":1,"actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"st","value":"${stale}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"isStale","value":"$[parseNumber::(${st},0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"k","value":"${ckey}"}},{"_note":"⚠️ 键为空时什么都不做 —— 空键 remove 无意义,随后的 reloadPage 会白跑一整轮网络。","op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${isStale},1),if::(gt::(length::(${k}),0),1,0),0)]"},"items":[{"action":"data.remove","params":{"key":"${k}"}},{"action":"xpage.reloadPage"}]}]}
